exports[`reports the latest card status on the next request without waking the conversation > cancelled page status 1`] = `
[
  {
    "text": "Latest status of action cards from user actions and background work. These are status facts, not a request to start or retry work. Use these receipts instead of the earlier proposal when describing progress. Cancelled means a started background creation was stopped before installation. Cancelled, failed or interrupted runs can be retried from their existing card; no new proposal is needed. A removed page can be restored from its card while its files remain; if they are gone, a new proposal is needed. Continue with the user’s current request.
